m und weitere gef\u00e4hrliche Wesen. W\u00e4hrend Odysseus um seine R\u00fcckkehr k\u00e4mpft, bedr\u00e4ngen in Ithaka Freier seine Frau Penelope und wollen die Herrschaft an sich bringen. Sein Sohn Telemachos macht sich auf die Suche nach dem vermissten Vater.","contentRating":{"minimumAge":12},"productionCountries":[{"name":"United States"}],"genres":[{"name":"Abenteuer"},{"name":"Action"},{"name":"Fantasy"}],"directors":[{"name":"Christopher Nolan"}],"actors":[{"name":"Matt Lasky"},{"name":"Matt Damon"},{"name":"Tom Holland"},{"name":"Anne Hathaway"},{"name":"Robert Pattinson"},{"name":"Lupita Nyong'o"},{"name":"Charlize Theron"},{"name":"Zendaya"},{"name":"Benny Safdie"},{"name":"Jon Bernthal"},{"name":"John Leguizamo"},{"name":"Himesh Patel"},{"name":"Mia Goth"},{"name":"Will Yun Lee"},{"name":"Jimmy Gonzales"},{"name":"Elliot Page"},{"name":"Bill Irwin"},{"name":"Samantha Morton"},{"name":"Jesse Garcia"},{"name":"Rafi Gavron"},{"name":"Shiloh Fernandez"},{"name":"Corey Hawkins"},{"name":"Nick E. Tarabay"},{"name":"Maurice Compte"},{"name":"Michael Vlamis"},{"name":"Iddo Goldberg"},{"name":"Josh Stewart"},{"name":"Ryan Hurst"},{"name":"Anthony Molinari"},{"name":"Jovan Adepo"},{"name":"Logan Marshall-Green"},{"name":"James Remar"},{"name":"Travis Scott"},{"name":"Douglas Rouillard"},{"name":"Jorge L\u00e9on"},{"name":"Andrei Lenart"},{"name":"Kamden Riley"},{"name":"Ryan de Quintal"},{"name":"Jarreth J. Merz"},{"name":"Markie Farnsley"},{"name":"Stephen Murphy"},{"name":"Adam Croasdell"},{"name":"Jamie Harris"},{"name":"Niko Nicotera"},{"name":"Elyes Gabel"},{"name":"Sean Avery"},{"name":"Andrew Howard"},{"name":"Lupita Nyong\u2019o"}],"thumbnailImage":{"url":"https:\/\/static.kinoheld.de\/images\/film\/die-odyssee-99061.v17811615267007.jpg"},"trailers":[{"url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=skiD2oYeCJY"},{"url":"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=1Js6B0_1-v4"}]}},{"name":"Godzilla Minus Zero","beginning":"2026-11-10T16:45:00+01:00","urlSlug":"17318","de